{"version":1,"id":"timeflies-once-in-a-while","title":"Once In A While","artist":"Timeflies","key":"Dm","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/timeflies/once-in-a-while/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b; 2 phrase(s) used deterministic fallback","credits":"Composed by: Rob Resnick and Cal Shapiro","chords":[{"symbol":"Bb","canonical":"Bb","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,2,5],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Dm","canonical":"Dm","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,5,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Gm","canonical":"Gm","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,10,2],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"I thought I would know better","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":20,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"That's wishful thinkin’","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Thought there'd be no pressure","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":31,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"That's wishful drinkin’","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Is anything forever or just a feeling?","columns":38,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":22,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":27,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"What have I been so afraid of?","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't know","columns":12,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":9,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 1]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"From Brooklyn to New York, then off to the West","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"In Cali, no Khaled, but fuck, we the best","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"My stripes, stay American, lemme express","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"And I keep it as live as a Total Request","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Then they ask me these questions","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Like, \"How do you do it?","columns":24,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":20,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Press and the road and the music”","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Truth is, I'm always up, I'm always down","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Worry about everyone else","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"section","text":"[Chorus]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"But once in a while, I catch myself","columns":47,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":32,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":46,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Once in a while, I ask myself","columns":40,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":25,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":39,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"What am I doing?","columns":16,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"Once in a while, I need your help","columns":43,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":18,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":28,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":42,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"But once in a while I feel like","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"I just wanna dance","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"I feel good,","columns":17,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":13,"beat":1.3333333333333333},{"symbol":"C","column":16,"beat":2.6666666666666665}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"(I feel good)","columns":16,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":12,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":15,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"I feel good,","columns":16,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":12,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":15,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"I feel good","columns":16,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":11,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":15,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 2]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"I live life like my blood type, B positive","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"These days something got me feeling quite the opposite","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Music like my heroin, but all I hear is poppy shit","columns":50,"beats":4